ktimetracker (4:5.4.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Unofficial fork based on 5.0.1
  * Included all changes of the kf5 branch
  * Backported all changes from the master branch
  * debian/patches: Drop patches, no longer applicable.
  * Add option to force the tray icon to be in the 'Active' state. This is
    useful for desktop environments (like MATE) that automatically hide
    'Passive' icons and lack a way to reveal them, unlike KDE.
  * The export to file dialog now remembers where you last saved, even after you
    restart KTimeTracker. This can be toggled off in the settings.
  * The export dialog now remembers the last used settings. This can be toggled
    off in the settings.
  * When exporting with "History as CSV" or "Event Log as CSV", the "From:" date
    picker will use the date of the oldest event by default instead of the
    current date.
  * Event Log export now includes seconds in the "Start" and "End" columns

 -- FlyingWolFox <49326973+FlyingWolFox@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 21 May 2026 17:18:00 -0300

